WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.760
INGLORIOM

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:23.040
Why are you still fighting
while lost in the depths of my mind?

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:27.280
We are one, Yugo.
Think before it's too late.

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:50.280
I'm disappointed, Dally, I thought you...

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.320
I will never be anything like you!

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:18.840
You... give me back my son, right now!

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:22.000
Something bad is happening out there.
If anything I'm...

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:34.520
Will you calm down, you little beast?

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:47.720
No way.

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:07.800
So, you're back from vacation?

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:13.200
Yeah, you could say that.
I saw what he did to you. I'm sorry.

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:18.680
-It wasn't your fault, buddy.
-Of course it's his fault. He created me.

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:23.400
If Yugo hadn't played god, I wouldn't be
here, beating the life out of you.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:37.240
You! I'm going to free you, but I promise
it's not going to be for the joy of it.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:42.360
And when this is over, we are going
to have a little talk about all this.

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:46.800
If we get out of this alive, we can have
as many talks as you want, Goultard.

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:49.880
You understand that by talk
I meant fight, revenge

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:53.200
and having my fist
in your nasty dragon face, right?

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:55.760
Yes, I did understand that...

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:08.440
Stop it! You're too weak
to handle these powers.

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:16.760
Thank you.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:20.280
-I didn't do it for you.
-I know, but, thanks all the same.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.480
Adamai! Nice to see you again, brother.

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:36.240
-Oropo!
-My little brother.

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:39.840
Now it's time to get
this family party started.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:45.000
Adamai, my intentions haven't changed.
I want to make a better world,

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:48.000
to replace those who rule us
but don't care about us.

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:51.560
You know it's Yugo's fault that I'm here.

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:56.520
He's the one who made me what I am,
a soulless being.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:05:01.440
You want to make all the gods disappear,
destroy a world. How could you?

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:04.080
Every evolution requires sacrifice.

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:21.120
I hope you got stronger
while you were away.

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:24.360
More than you I bet.
Plus, I didn't forget to grow up.

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:28.840
That was a cheap shot. I need to touch
the Eliacube. Can you distract him?

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:33.000
I beg you not to do anything stupid.
Just let me finish this.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:36.120
You'll see, one day,
we'll look back on this and smile.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.680
How could I have been so blind?

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:43.640
How's this for a diversion, Yugo?

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:46.760
You're going to regret this.

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:19.520
This should help
make everything right again.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.080
You think?

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:32.080
I've been controlling this power
much longer than you have.

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:36.720
It's true you've already practiced
a little on Ogrest and Nox,

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:40.240
but don't forget
I am a more experienced version of you.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:43.320
-How could you win?
-Because I'm younger and faster!

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:57.400
I missed some things.
Are you a good guy again?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:06:59.800
I always was.

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:17.600
I told you, I am you, only better!

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.560
How you think--

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:30.640
How you fight...
I can see you coming from a mile away.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.080
Mama!

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:05.160
They... They were just born.
They shouldn't be able to walk.

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:09.160
No, he shouldn't be able to...

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:14.880
Sipho! That coward.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:17.720
He's just trying to slow us down.

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:25.240
Don't tell me his first fight
is at this age. It's impossible.

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:27.480
It's possible, but I wish it wasn't.

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:38.240
It's okay, Mama, I've got him.
I recognize his fighting style already.

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:43.440
The more I know you,
the better I understand

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.320
why Oropo wants your children
to be the new gods.

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:49.920
The more I know you, the more
I want to knock you senseless.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:53.080
Listen, I don't want to hurt any of you.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:57.120
But I was given orders to keep you here.
It was for your own safety.

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:00.840
Can I hit him, Mama?
Say yes, please, please, please!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:05.680
Okay, but play nice with your brother.
No arguing.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:08.920
But Papa doesn't like it
when two fight against one.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:11.960
-It's that or nothing.
-Okay, big bro, let's do it.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:13.600
How are we going to do it?

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:15.880
Mm. The broken-nose technique!

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:18.320
I'm not sure that's the kind of behavior

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:20.840
you want to teach
your children, Evangelyne.

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:23.560
Perhaps, but it's not up to you.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:31.720
All we needed was another fighter
in the family.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:35.680
-I hit him before you did.
-Doesn't count. You hit like a princess.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:38.920
-Yes, it counts!
-You couldn't knock him out on your own!

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.360
You couldn't even hit him on your own!

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:54.080
Echo!

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:01.560
Coward! Well done, big bro.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:03.680
Well done, little sis!

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:06.880
Okay, children, time to find your father.

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:10.720
You argue a lot, but when
you work together, you work wonders.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:44.440
No, no, not now!

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:58.040
I'm slowly starting to fade.

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:03.720
My days here are numbered.
Without the Eliacube to keep me alive,

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:06.160
I'd have already disappeared long ago.

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:11.320
Don't realize what you did to us, Yugo,
when you played god? It's all your fault!

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:26.240
We all have a dark side, but the strength
of a real hero is not giving in to it.

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:31.640
For doing horrible things, your excuse
was you were a version of Yugo.

00:11:32.360 --> 00:11:36.280
All you did was find someone
to blame for all your destruction.

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:40.600
You're nothing like Yugo
and never will be!

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:45.360
Despite the mistakes he's made, he'd
rather sacrifice himself than hurt others.

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:19.120
Keep your illusions.
You're never going to change my mind!

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:54.000
Don't tell me I missed the final battle!

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.040
Oh, no, I didn't. Whew!

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:02.840
Just a few more seconds. You won't
lead me away from my chosen path.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:05.680
He'll enter the portal and close it off.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:07.800
Yugo, we need a solution quickly.

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:10.720
We're stuck
and the Eliacube is about to explode.

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:13.920
If Oropo leaves,
he'll destroy Ingloriom and the gods.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:17.840
If we keep him here, this dimension
will disappear with us in it.

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:32.320
Wow! That looks super handy! Rubi?

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:35.240
-What? You want a pair, too?
-You can do that?

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:40.800
Like this?

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:45.440
How cool, you outdid yourself
with these! Thank you, Rubi!

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:53.840
Okay, this is going
to take some getting used to.

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:59.160
-Papa!
-Awesome wings, Papa!

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:00.600
They are, aren't they?

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:04.080
Very nice,
but no bringing them into the house.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:07.720
Right, time to stop thinking
and start doing!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:16.320
All this power! I can do anything!
I'm invincible!

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:47.680
We can't let him reach the portal!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:45.240
My dear brother,
without the six Dofus giving you a boost,

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:47.520
you're not exactly up to par.

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:11.680
No... Not my friends!

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:24.880
Mishell.

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:12.080
I've always been on your side, Oropo,
but you've gone too far.

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:18.280
-Get him away from the portal!
-There's no way we can let you leave.

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:22.160
I know. But I also know
that none of you are able to stop me.

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:24.720
It'll all be over soon.

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:39.240
There is one solution.

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:47.360
I think I know what you're planning
and I won't leave you here alone.

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:49.000
I won't be alone, Sipho.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:37.040
No! Don't do that to me, mistress!

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:50.480
Are you insane?

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:55.280
You sent them to Ingloriom!

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:59.000
I foiled your plans, darling.
Whatever you decide, it's over.

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:03.640
If you jump into that Zaap and set off
the Eliabomb, there'll be no gods left.

00:19:03.720 --> 00:19:07.280
Neither old gods nor our children,
who were to replace them.

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:11.120
Traitor! How could you do that to me?

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:13.240
I could ask you the same thing.

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:17.800
I did all this
to make the world a better place.

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:21.280
You took a huge risk, Echo.

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:31.120
That's what I was planning on.

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:37.720
I was really trying to do good.
I wish it could end differently.

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:39.280
I know.

